        <mxCell id="mod3_title" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot; color=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;The Reinforcement Learning Loop: How PPO Eliminates Tardiness&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="110" y="894" width="600" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Card A: Reward -->
        <mxCell id="loop_card_a" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#991B1B&quot;&gt;Step A: Immediate Penalty&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding-left:5px;&quot;&gt;$$r_t = - [ w_M \Delta C_{\max} + w_S S_{\text{best}} + w_T \frac{\Delta \text{EstTard}_j}{N_{\text{jobs}}} + w_I \frac{I_{\text{best}}}{10} ]$$&lt;br&gt;• Scaled by: $$1 / \text{reward\_scale} (1000)$$&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font color=&quot;#DC2626&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;If action causes overrun:&lt;br&gt;  ΔEstTard_j &gt; 0 ⇒ r_t drops heavily!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font color=&quot;#15803D&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;If action prevents overrun:&lt;br&gt;  ΔEstTard_j = 0 ⇒ Zero tardiness penalty!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="935" width="260" height="235" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="arrow_a_b" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=2.5;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="335" y="1050" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="365" y="1050" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Card B: PPO Policy Gradient -->
        <mxCell id="loop_card_b" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#92400E&quot;&gt;Step B: Policy Gradient Update&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding-left:5px;&quot;&gt;Advantage estimation (GAE):&lt;br&gt;$$\hat{A}_t = \delta_t + (\gamma \lambda) \delta_{t+1} + \dots$$&lt;br&gt;PPO Clipped Objective:&lt;br&gt;$$\mathcal{L}^{\text{CLIP}}(\theta) = \hat{\mathbb{E}} [ \min(\rho_t \hat{A}_t, \text{clip} \cdot \hat{A}_t) ]$$&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font color=&quot;#DC2626&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Negative Advantage (Â_t &lt; 0):&lt;br&gt;  Suppresses logits for bad choices!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font color=&quot;#15803D&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Positive Advantage (Â_t &gt; 0):&lt;br&gt;  Reinforces timely dispatch choices!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="370" y="935" width="260" height="235" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="arrow_b_c" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=2.5;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="635" y="1050" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="665" y="1050" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Card C: Emergent Rules -->
        <mxCell id="loop_card_c" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14532D&quot;&gt;Step C: Learned Dispatch Rules&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding-left:5px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#16A34A&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. MST (Minimum Slack Time):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Prioritizes jobs where Slack → 0 before safe jobs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#EA580C&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. WSPT / Due Date Priority:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Always saves Super_Hot (10×) over Regular (1×) jobs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0284C7&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Setup-Aware Clustering:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Avoids redundant setup time to prevent tool blockage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7C3AED&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Zero Infeasible Actions:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Action Masking blocks finished jobs.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="670" y="935" width="220" height="235" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Bottom Banner Summary -->
        <mxCell id="summary_banner" value="&lt;b&gt;Mathematical Formulation: Exact Code Alignment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;$$r_t = - \frac{1}{\text{scale}} \left[ w_M \Delta C_{\max} + w_S S_{\text{best}} + w_T \left( \frac{\Delta \text{EstTard}_j}{N_{\text{jobs}}} \right) + w_I \left( \frac{I_{\text{best}}}{10} \right) \right]$$&lt;br&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding-left:20px;&quot;&gt;• &lt;font color=&quot;#DC2626&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ΔEstTard_j = max(0, new_est_tard - curr_est_tardiness[j]):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; Penalizes any scheduling decision that delays job completion past its due date.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font color=&quot;#15803D&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Credit Assignment Resolved:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; The gradient directly attributes the penalty to the specific dispatch action that caused the delay, enabling fast convergence.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1190" width="820" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
